<p>Russia said it will send a second oil tanker to Cuba, days after the Russian tanker Anatoly Kolodkin arrived with about 700,000 to 730,000 barrels of crude, as the island grapples with a fuel shortage. Russian Energy Minister Sergei Tsivilyov said the new shipment reflects Moscow’s support for Cuba, which has struggled to secure enough imported fuel. The move offers Cuba a near-term source of supply at a moment when the country produces only about 40% of the fuel it needs and depends heavily on imports. The reporting also frames the deliveries in the context of a long-running US embargo and more recent sanctions pressure on shipping linked to Cuba’s oil trade, factors that have complicated the island’s access to fuel.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/8kyHyZ-ioa8oaW0-0AFhKEiw0fL80dbrhY03Nao7LuNOyJKjX-92or-YHcWEEgdP6VkoKrVRC3AvCcxQA9Gx93hW0vByC4Ax4c-T5eh9ND8DgWfdXigAV14AvL1Y8HSJN2NbrH4ZbWDFOG8pXXaZXuH-g26s3kLe3vpK7O7SD6jRReeYaJN3QM6IM-Z9FIZYTT-9vXM_8EYFzMhVj_9nkDZ7NKDjEYetnAz-CBTYtx3kBHqiGNghJ0JuqWxFcSeXAJtSVju4Y1SRdoSzNg' alt='A tugboat guides the Russian oil tanker Anatoly Kolodkin at the oil terminal in the port of Matanzas, Cuba, on March 31, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/2/russia-sending-second-ship-with-oil-to-cuba-amid-us-blockade'>Russia sending second ship with oil to Cuba amid US blockade</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-russia-intends-to-send-second-oil-tanker-to-cuba-after-arrival-of/'>Russia intends to send second oil tanker to Cuba after arrival of Anatoly Kolodkin</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/02/russia-to-send-second-oil-tanker-to-cuba-as-energy-crisis-continues-moscow-says'>Russia to send second oil tanker to Cuba as energy crisis continues, Moscow says</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/moscow-plans-send-2nd-oil-tanker-cuba-russian-131655243'>Mosco